{
  "id": "ISA.41",
  "number": "41",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaiah 41",
  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "41",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 41"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "41",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keep silence before me, O islands; and let the peoples renew their strength: let them come near; then let them speak; let us come near together to judgment. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who hath raised up one from the east, whom he calleth in righteousness to his foot? he giveth nations before him, and maketh him rule over kings; he giveth them as the dust to his sword, as the driven stubble to his bow. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He pursueth them, and passeth on safely, even by a way that he had not gone with his feet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who hath wrought and done it, calling the generations from the beginning? I, Jehovah, the first, and with the last, I am he. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The isles have seen, and fear; the ends of the earth tremble; they draw near, and come. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They help every one his neighbor; and ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " saith to his brother, Be of good courage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the carpenter encourageth the goldsmith, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " he that smootheth with the hammer him that smiteth the anvil, saying of the soldering, It is good; and he fasteneth it with nails, that it should not be moved.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But thou, Israel, my servant, Jacob whom I have chosen, the seed of Abraham my friend, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou whom I have taken hold of from the ends of the earth, and called from the corners thereof, and said unto thee, Thou art my servant, I have chosen thee and not cast thee away; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fear thou not, for I am with thee; be not dismayed, for I am thy God; I will strengthen thee; yea, I will help thee; yea, I will uphold thee with the right hand of my righteousness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, all they that are incensed against thee shall be put to shame and confounded: they that strive with thee shall be as nothing, and shall perish. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt seek them, and shalt not find them, even them that contend with thee: they that war against thee shall be as nothing, and as a thing of nought. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I, Jehovah thy God, will hold thy right hand, saying unto thee, Fear not; I will help thee. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fear not, thou worm Jacob, and ye men of Israel; I will help thee, saith Jehovah, and thy Redeemer is the Holy One of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, I have made thee ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " a new sharp threshing instrument having teeth; thou shalt thresh the mountains, and beat them small, and shalt make the hills as chaff. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thou shalt winnow them, and the wind shall carry them away, and the whirlwind shall scatter them; and thou shalt rejoice in Jehovah, thou shalt glory in the Holy One of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The poor and needy seek water, and there is none, and their tongue faileth for thirst; I, Jehovah, will answer them, I, the God of Israel, will not forsake them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will open rivers on the bare heights, and fountains in the midst of the valleys; I will make the wilderness a pool of water, and the dry land springs of water. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will put in the wilderness the cedar, the acacia, and the myrtle, and the oil-tree; I will set in the desert the fir-tree, the pine, and the box-tree together: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that they may see, and know, and consider, and understand together, that the hand of Jehovah hath done this, and the Holy One of Israel hath created it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Produce your cause, saith Jehovah; bring forth your strong reasons, saith the King of Jacob. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let them bring forth, and declare unto us what shall happen: declare ye the former things, what they are, that we may consider them, and know the latter end of them; or show us things to come. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Declare the things that are to come hereafter, that we may know that ye are gods: yea, do good, or do evil, that we may be dismayed, and behold it together. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, ye are of nothing, and your work is of nought; an abomination is he that chooseth you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have raised up one from the north, and he is come; from the rising of the sun one that calleth upon my name: and he shall come upon rulers as upon mortar, and as the potter treadeth clay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who hath declared it from the beginning, that we may know? and beforetime, that we may say, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " right? yea, there is none that declareth, yea, there is none that showeth, yea, there is none that heareth your words. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " first ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " unto Zion, Behold, behold them; and I will give to Jerusalem one that bringeth good tidings. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when I look, there is no man: even among them there is no counsellor, that, when I ask of them, can answer a word. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 41:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Behold, all of them, their works are vanity ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " nought; their molten images are wind and confusion.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.41.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.41.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
